    <briefdescription>
<para>Quantics Tensor Train representation with reversible index metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Produced by <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_hiss_reshaper_1a3b8d787f17f79ffa0f66490220f7ca2e" kindref="member">HissReshaper::exposeQuantics()</ref></computeroutput>. Contains the pure-binary QTT decomposition of the (zero-padded) input tensor plus all metadata required to round-trip back to the original dense tensor without data loss.</para>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_train_1a14f3deee4e863572c0a18af8f53dd5bc" kindref="member">mapping</ref></computeroutput> field provides a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_t_mapping_descriptor" kindref="compound">QTTMappingDescriptor</ref></computeroutput> that maps flat physical indices (into the unpadded tensor) to flat QTT indices and vice versa; use it to distinguish valid payload elements from zero-padding when reconstructing the original dense tensor from <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_train_1a4911dc8f498d9181595cf46ce443d5e3" kindref="member">toTTTrain()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
